      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "189321dd244f03b4",
      "translationZh": "打包后的权重为 247 MB：体积比 BF16 小 13.9×。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "12c500c1d56b20e6",
      "translationZh": "在我们的 10 项任务评测中，平均得分达到 BF16 模型的 85.9%——优于 1-bit Bonsai-1.7B，且几乎与 1.58-bit Bonsai-1.7B 持平。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9b1ece609328f63b",
